OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused put money in dead
OL,4,Awoman's account
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury in the trial of a man accused
OL,7,Fof murdering a woman has been shown
OL,8,Ffootage of him going into a bank to put
OL,9,Fmoney into her account while she was
OL,10,Fdead in a freezer at his home.
OL,12,FGeorge Gordon was captured on CCTV
OL,13,Fgoing into a bank in St Helens on 8
OL,14,FJanuary this year, the same day police
OL,15,Fwent to Delia McInerney's home in
OL,16,FLiverpool to look for her.
OL,18,FLiverpool Crown Court heard Gordon had
OL,19,Ftold police "she's in the freezer" when
OL,20,Fthey went to his home in Gerard's Court
OL,21,Fin St Helens after failing to find her
OL,22,Fat her own house.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
