OL,4,Awoman's account
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon is accused of murdering
OL,7,FMcInerney in April 2023, which he
OL,8,Fdenies, but he has admitted killing
OL,9,Fher, and carrying out fraudulent
OL,10,Ffinancial activity after her death.
